-- nothing stated: both settings at their defaults
disk	default	default	default
persistent	1	1	default
-- stated: reported as the definition, and nothing else is
disk	default	definition
persistent	0	definition
-- the unused format setting still stays in the definition
1
-- the two rows it reports agree with what `system.engine_settings` says of the engine
0
-- and the engine describes those two and nothing else, so the two tables agree about this engine
2	1
-- `persistent` is the value the engine acts on
0
-- a temporary table reports its definition too
persistent	0	definition
